Clarification: the issue appeared in part 1, so even if you got part 1 running apparently well in your previous script, you need to re-run your files. Make sure you set overwrite = TRUE.

Specifically, the problem raised when there were many time gaps very close in gt3x files (only affecting those recordings that have been collected with the idle sleep mode by ActiGraph).

Best,
Jairo

